        <obo:IAO_0000115>The epithelium of upper vagina (syn: epithelial layer of upper part of vagina) (TS:24-TS:27). The epithelial layer of the upper vagina is selectively marked by Wnt7a at E17 (absent from sinovaginal bulb epithelium) (Abler et al, 2011).</obo:IAO_0000115>
