        <owl:annotatedTarget>The muscle of upper vagina (syn: muscular layer of upper part of vagina) (TS:24-TS:27) is the smooth muscle layer of the upper vagina. Marked by Crabp1 at E17 (Abler et al, 2011) and alpha smooth muscle actin and gamma smooth muscle actin.</owl:annotatedTarget>
