    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/EMAPA_30699 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/EMAPA_30699">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/EMAPA_38171"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/EMAPA_18680"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/EMAPA_30819"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The prepuce of female (pce) (TS:24-TS:28) surrounds the glans clitoris and body of clitoris, but does not contain a preputial space. TS:24-TS:27 prepuce of female is comprised of skin, preputial glands and mesenchyme of prepuce. From TS:28, prepuce of female is comprised of skin, preputial glands and lamina propria of prepuce. Part of the genital tubercle of female (TS:24) and from TS:25-TS:28 part of the clitoris. Derived from preputial swelling of female (TS:21-TS:23).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>anatomical_structure</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>EMAPA:30699</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>prepuce of female</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/EMAPA_30699"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>The prepuce of female (pce) (TS:24-TS:28) surrounds the glans clitoris and body of clitoris, but does not contain a preputial space. TS:24-TS:27 prepuce of female is comprised of skin, preputial glands and mesenchyme of prepuce. From TS:28, prepuce of female is comprised of skin, preputial glands and lamina propria of prepuce. Part of the genital tubercle of female (TS:24) and from TS:25-TS:28 part of the clitoris. Derived from preputial swelling of female (TS:21-TS:23).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:25968320</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


