        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The muscle layer of prostatic urethra (muprur) (TS:28-28) is the thick layer of muscle towards the outside of the prostatic urethra. Subdivided into smooth muscle layer of prostatic urethra and rhabdosphincter of male (syn: striated muscle layer of prostatic urethra).</obo:IAO_0000115>
