        <obo:IAO_0000115>The muscle layer of ventral pelvic urethra of male (TS:23-TS:27). The thicker layer of smooth muscle towards the outside of the pelvic urethra. Subdivided into dorsal/ventral (to TS:27). Marked by proteins expressed by smooth muscle cells, such as smooth muscle alpha actin (Acta2).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>anatomical_structure</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>EMAPA:31555</oboInOwl:id>
