        <obo:IAO_0000115>The rhabdosphincter of male (syn: striated muscle layer of prostatic urethra) (TS:28-28) is the striated muscle layer towards the outside of the prostatic urethra. Part of the prostatic urethra, part of the urethra of male. Marked by proteins expressed by skeletal muscle cells, such as skeletal muscle alpha actin (Acta1).</obo:IAO_0000115>
