        <obo:IAO_0000115>The lamina propria of upper vagina (syn: mesenchymal layer of upper part of vagina) (TS:24-TS:27) is the connective tissue layer located between the epithelial layer and the muscular layer of the upper vagina. Marked by Amhr2 and Crabp1 at E17 (Abler et al, 2011).</obo:IAO_0000115>
