                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002493"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/TS_28"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The superficial cell layer of bladder urothelium (syn: luminal cell layer of bladder urothelium) (TS:22-TS:28) is the epithelial layer of cells lining the bladder lumen, comprised of superficial cells and intermediate cells of bladder urothelium from TS:22-TS:28.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>anatomical_structure</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>luminal cell layer of bladder urothelium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>EMAPA:32273</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>superficial cell layer of bladder urothelium</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/EMAPA_32273"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>The superficial cell layer of bladder urothelium (syn: luminal cell layer of bladder urothelium) (TS:22-TS:28) is the epithelial layer of cells lining the bladder lumen, comprised of superficial cells and intermediate cells of bladder urothelium from TS:22-TS:28.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:25968320</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/EMAPA_32274 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/EMAPA_32274">
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/EMAPA_28601"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002489"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/TS_22"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002493"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/TS_28"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The basal cell layer of bladder urothelium (TS:22-TS:28) is the cell layer at the base of the urothelium adjacent to the basement membrane, comprised of different cell types dependant on stage. At TS:22, is comprised solely of intermediate cells (prior to the identification of Krt5-expressing basal cells), from TS:23-TS:24 is comprised of intermediate and Krt5-expressing basal cells of bladder urothelium, and from TS:25-TS:28 is comprised solely of Krt5-expressing basal cells of bladder urothelium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>anatomical_structure</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>EMAPA:32274</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>basal cell layer of bladder urothelium</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/EMAPA_32274"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>The basal cell layer of bladder urothelium (TS:22-TS:28) is the cell layer at the base of the urothelium adjacent to the basement membrane, comprised of different cell types dependant on stage. At TS:22, is comprised solely of intermediate cells (prior to the identification of Krt5-expressing basal cells), from TS:23-TS:24 is comprised of intermediate and Krt5-expressing basal cells of bladder urothelium, and from TS:25-TS:28 is comprised solely of Krt5-expressing basal cells of bladder urothelium.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:25968320</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


