        <obo:IAO_0000115>The presumptive neural crest derivative of pelvic urethra of male (TS:23-TS:27). Lineage tracing with a neural crest Cre driver has not been carried out but likely to be neural crest derived given location and presence in both male and female.</obo:IAO_0000115>
