        <owl:annotatedTarget>The submucosa of ventral pelvic urethra of male (TS:25-TS:28) is the mesenchymal layer located below the muscularis mucosa of pelvic urethra, between the muscularis mucosa and muscle layer of pelvic urethra, comprised of mesenchymal/fibroblastic cells. Marked by Foxf1a mRNA at E17. Can be distinguished from the lamina propria of pelvic urethra as it does not express Snai1 mRNA at E17.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:25968320</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


