        <owl:annotatedTarget>The smooth muscle layer of pelvic urethra of female (TS:28-28) is the smooth muscle layer towards the outside of the pelvic urethra. Part of the pelvic urethra, part of the urethra of female. Marked by proteins expressed by smooth muscle cells, such as smooth muscle alpha actin (Acta2).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:25968320</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
