        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The rhabdosphincter of female (syn: striated muscle layer of pelvic urethra of female) (TS:28) is the striated muscle layer towards the outside of the pelvic urethra of female. Part of the pelvic urethra, part of the urethra of female. Marked by proteins expressed by skeletal muscle cells, such as skeletal muscle alpha actin (Acta1).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>anatomical_structure</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>striated muscle layer of pelvic urethra of female</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
