        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The adventitia of pelvic urethra of female (aplur) (TS:23-TS:28) is the outer connective tissue layer of the pelvic urethra. The pelvic urethra is not surrounded by an outer serous membrane or serosa.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>anatomical_structure</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
