        <owl:annotatedTarget>The adventitia of pelvic urethra of female (aplur) (TS:23-TS:28) is the outer connective tissue layer of the pelvic urethra. The pelvic urethra is not surrounded by an outer serous membrane or serosa.</owl:annotatedTarget>
