            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The adventitia of pelvic urethra of male (aplur) (TS:23-TS:28) is the outer connective tissue layer of the pelvic urethra. The pelvic urethra is not surrounded by an outer serous membrane or serosa.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>anatomical_structure</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>EMAPA:36131</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>adventitia of pelvic urethra of male</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
