            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The urethral gland of pelvic urethra of female (syn: Skene&apos;s gland) (TS:27-TS:28). Epithelial urethral glands develop from the epithelium of the urethra. Develop from female urethral gland bud (TS:24-TS:26 and become female urethral gland (TS:27-TS:28) which is subdivided into urethral gland of pelvic urethra of female (part of the pelvic urethra) and urethral gland of clitoral urethra (part of the clitoral urethra).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>anatomical_structure</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
