        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The adventitia of prostatic urethra (TS:28) is the outer connective tissue layer of the prostatic urethra. The prostatic urethra is not surrounded by an outer serous membrane or serosa.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>anatomical_structure</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
